Third-party documents in this folder
====================================

The `input.docx` files under `tests/fixtures/scraped/` are real-world
documents collected from the public web. They are here only as test input
for checking layout against Microsoft Word; they are not part of
docxide-pdf, are not covered by its Apache-2.0 license, and are not
shipped in the published crate.

