Ownership
---------

ODC-By covers the docx-corpus database (the collection, its selection and
arrangement). It does not license copyright in the individual documents
(section 2.4 of the license). Each document remains the property of its
author or rights holder, who keeps all rights to it. Some documents may
name people or contain their contact details; do not use them to identify
or profile anyone.

The `reference.pdf` files next to them are this project's exports of those
documents through Microsoft Word; the rights in the documents' content
stay with its owners there too.

Removal
-------

If you own one of these documents and want it removed, open an issue on
this repository naming the fixture folder, and we will delete it. To have
it removed from docx-corpus as well, email help@docxcorp.us with the
document's hash or URL.
